 "transnational": false,
 "intro_zh": "卢戈城墙修建于公元3世纪末期，用于保卫罗马城镇卢戈斯。整个圆形城墙至今保存完好，是西欧罗马帝国晚期城堡的最完美样例之一。",
 "intro_zh_source": "unesco_official",
 "intro_en": "The walls of Lugo were built in the later part of the 3rd century to defend the Roman town of Lucus. The entire circuit survives intact and is the finest example of late Roman fortifications in western Europe.",
 "intro_en_source": "unesco_official",
 "intro_local": "La muralla de Lugo fue construida a finales de siglo II para defender la ciudad romana de Lucus. Su perímetro se ha conservado intacto en su totalidad y constituye el más bello arquetipo de fortificación romana tardía de toda Europa Occidental.",
 "intro_local_source": "unesco_official",
